            </table>

            <div style={{ fontSize: "8.5pt", color: "#475569", fontStyle: "italic", borderTop: "1px dashed #cbd5e1", paddingTop: "8px" }}>
              * Note: This quotation estimate is valid for the specified period. Final billing will be governed by the signed Works Contract Agreement.
